┌──────────┬─────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Command  │ Argument    │ Does                                              │
├──────────┼─────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ :help    │             │ This table                                        │
│ :type    │ <expr>      │ The type of an expression, without evaluating it  │
│ :layout  │ <type|expr> │ Size, alignment and fields in memory              │
│ :ir      │ [expr]      │ The LLVM IR of the last line, or of an expression │
│ :asm     │ <name>      │ The machine code a function materialised as       │
│ :src     │ <name>      │ The source a declaration was written as           │
│ :doc     │ <name>      │ The block comment above a declaration             │
│ :bench   │ [n] <expr>  │ Run an expression n times and time it             │
│ :history │             │ Every line this session has evaluated             │
│ :vars    │             │ Every variable declared at this prompt            │
│ :reset   │             │ Throw the session away and start a fresh one      │
│ :exit    │             │ Leave (so does ^D)                                │
└──────────┴─────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
